     {
      "pClass": "productdescription",
      "pText": "Gloden Hour is a long, narrow play station in Play Orange and Play Yellow, measuring 39'4\" x 20'9\". That shape lets it run along a boundary wall or beside a podium garden where a square unit would not fit. Canopy towers shade the decks, a rock wall offers a way up and a tube slide brings children back down. Swinging is part of the activity list too. It is listed for ages 3+, with key users from 3 to 12 and a capacity of 15. Keep a safe play area of 45'4\" x 25'9\" around it. We cover galvanised pipe, roto-moulded parts, composite laminates and play rope under a 3-year warranty. Send us your plot dimensions for a layout."
     }
